WEBVTT

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:11.690
Paw Pad Legends

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:11.050
Jeez, they're so loud...

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:11.690
Hey!

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:13.320
Gimme a snack!

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.820
Sure, if this is okay.

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:23.820
Snack time!

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:25.820
Hey! Those are mine!

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:27.240
Darn it, Kurumi!

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:29.590
Sit down and be quiet!

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:33.060
Aw, I can't be quiet!

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:34.930
We're all heading to school at sea together!

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.760
Oh! Jin!

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:39.260
I can see it!

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:43.020
Seton Academy's branch campus, Sea Academy!

00:00:52.550 --> 00:00:57.010
<b>Join the Pack!</b>

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:57.010
<b>Seton Academy</b>

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:18.640
<b>Unnatural interspecies relations are strictly forbidden!!</b>

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:28.650
<b>Miyubi: Dead</b>

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:15.320
<b>Seton Academy Record 8      The Beach Bard</b>

00:02:13.790 --> 00:02:15.360
Hello, everyone.

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:17.790
I'm the headmaster, Ohba.

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:21.200
I hope your five days here 
at Sea Academy will be—

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.200
Yahoo!

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:29.050
Wow, this school building's 
really pretty.

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:29.910
Hmph!

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:31.080
Hey, look!

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:34.340
The student uniform here is a swimsuit!

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:35.750
How cute!

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:37.010
I wanna wear one!

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:37.720
Hmph!

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:42.060
The classrooms are actually in the ocean!

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:44.100
Wow...

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:45.350
Hmph!

00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:48.490
Their dorm is a boat!

00:02:48.490 --> 00:02:50.060
That's so cool!

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:50.600
Hmph!

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:53.900
Whether it's by the sea or not, 
it's still a school full of animals.

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:55.340
<b>Buzzkill...</b>

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:59.360
<i>That said, the picturesque setting 
makes it feel like a resort.</i>

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:01.210
I wonder what the students are like!

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:01.850
<i>This means...</i>

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:01.860
Yeah...

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:05.740
<i>It's the perfect chance to 
get closer to Hitomi-chan!</i>

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.620
Hi, everyone from Seton Academy!

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:11.250
Welcome to Sea Academy!

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:13.880
I hope you have a good time here!

00:03:14.190 --> 00:03:15.700
Is she a dolphin, too?

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:17.130
A beluga whale, actually.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:19.480
<i>Order: Artiodactyla; family: 
Monodontidae; genus: </i>Delphinapterus<i>...</i>

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:20.620
<i>the beluga whale.</i>

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:23.580
<i>Taxonomically, there is very little 
difference between dolphins and whales.</i>

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:26.140
<i>In general, species less than four 
meters in length are dolphins,</i>

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:30.140
<b>Dolphin 
4M or Less</b>

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:30.140
<b>Whale 
More Than 4M</b>

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:30.140
<b>Beluga 
5M</b>

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:28.010
<i>while those that grow larger 
are classified as whales,</i>

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:30.140
<i>but this species is considered an exception.</i>

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:34.900
I, Shiraumi Kana, present 
to you our welcome show!

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:34.900
<b>Bowie Bow</b>

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:45.410
How beautiful!

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:46.870
Wow, amazing!

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:53.730
Th-The end...

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:54.580
That's it?!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.850
Hey, that's no fun!

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:57.460
Huh?!

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:59.510
Er... um...

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:04.390
I'm sorry!

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:06.390
What was her deal?

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:08.100
What was that all about?

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:10.770
Well... it doesn't seem to be in the guide.

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:14.140
It does say there'll be a show 
by the synchronized swimming club

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:15.150
<b>☆Last Day 
Show Presented By the Sea Academy Students in the Stadium 
• Humpback Whale Jumps 
• Steller Sea Lion Swallowing Salmon Whole 
• Walrus Performance 
• Sea Lion Ball Performance 

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:15.150
on the last day...

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:18.270
I guess she was just putting 
on her own personal show?

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:20.610
She went through all that 
trouble to welcome us.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.490
I hope she's not off by herself being depressed.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:26.090
<i>There goes that dumb dog again!</i>

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:30.150
<i>Now she's gonna say we should 
go and cheer her up!</i>

00:04:30.150 --> 00:04:31.580
<i>Wait a minute.</i>

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.910
<i>If I send her to talk to the stupid beluga,</i>

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:36.460
<i>it'll be easier to get some 
time alone with Hitomi-chan!</i>

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:39.870
Okay! Go help her, stupid mutt!

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:40.620
Jin!

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:44.250
That beluga needs a boss 
she can lean on right now!

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.680
A b-boss?!

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:47.260
And who's a boss?

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:48.010
I am!

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:49.510
Who's a reliable boss?!

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:50.510
I am!

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:52.410
All right! Go, boss!

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:55.700
Sounds fun! I'm going, too!

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:56.480
Wait, Meimei!

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:57.600
Combo clear!

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:59.150
Ranka-chan...

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:01.360
You think she'll be okay?

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:03.240
What?

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.110
You came to help me?

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:05.820
Yeah!

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:06.990
Leave everything to us!

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:09.330
Ranka-san, Meimei-san...

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:11.010
Thank you!

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:12.620
But how are you going to help?

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:15.580
Meimei's gonna teach you the 
secrets of putting on a show!

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:18.910
Just leave it all to your 
resident super-top-class idol.

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:19.590
Fengfeng...

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:21.290
Bring us the thing.

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:22.210
Got it!

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:23.710
Heave-ho!

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.470
Wh-What are we doing with a tire?

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:28.590
Take this...

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:29.800
and do this...

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:30.930
and this...

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:32.020
and this!

00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:33.270
That's all?!

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:36.050
Trust me! It'll make everyone squeal!

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:38.300
As the boss, I'll take full responsibility!

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:39.440
<b>* This only 
\h\h\h\h\hworks for pandas</b>

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:39.440
Me, too!

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:40.800
Uh-huh...

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:44.280
But our synchronized swimming 
club is really good.

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:45.770
Synchronized swimming?

00:05:45.770 --> 00:05:49.530
Yes. They're Sea Academy's idols. 
A pod of bottlenose dolphins.

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:53.410
Their perfectly synchronized, 
dynamic tricks are amazing.

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:56.040
I wish I could swim on the 
same stage as them.

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:58.790
But they won't let me join the club.

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:00.070
Why not?

00:06:00.070 --> 00:06:01.920
Because...

00:06:15.010 --> 00:06:15.770
She...

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:18.270
She's standing on the water?!

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:22.770
The tail walk is a trick in which 
dolphins "stand" upright to move.

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:27.000
That's the synchronized swimming 
club captain, Bando Ruka-senpai!

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:27.780
Kana...

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:30.280
I hear you put on your own show.

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:35.410
Let's see... Ten kilometers 
up the mountain

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:37.010
is the Dolphin Shrine.

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:40.670
If we go fifteen kilometers this way, 
there's something called Whale Falls.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:43.510
And this is thirty kilometers... 
forty kilometers...

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:43.810
<b>Seaside School Guide 
Sea Academy</b>

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:46.180
These are distances only an animal could travel!

00:06:46.180 --> 00:06:50.030
We won't be able to visit any of those 
and be back before free time ends.

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:53.370
Anyway, I wonder what Ranka-chan 
and the rest are doing.

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:56.970
Huh? Just let that dumb dog be.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.040
But we're curious, right?

00:06:58.040 --> 00:06:59.150
Yeah!

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:00.690
Me, too.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:03.610
She offered to help someone 
she'd only just met.

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:05.210
That's just like Ranka-chan.

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:07.220
We should go, too!

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:11.070
That girl might be able to tell 
us where to get some great food!

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:12.730
Well, then, let's go!

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:15.140
Yeah, let's!

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:13.820
Hey!

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:15.140
Hey!

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:18.770
Damn it... I can't deal with 
this every single time!

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:23.040
Hey!

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:26.370
Why won't you let Kana join the 
synchronized swimming club?

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:27.770
Yeah! Yeah!

00:07:27.770 --> 00:07:30.410
Meanie! Meanie! Meanie!

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:32.380
Kana knows the reason better than anyone.

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:36.760
A beluga can't keep up with bottlenose dolphins.

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:40.270
No amount of effort you put in will change that.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:44.540
I can't allow someone who knows 
she'll ruin our stage into our pod,

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:46.770
much less allow her to perform in our show!

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:52.490
What's so funny?!

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:53.990
I'm crying!

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:57.610
<i>Beluga whales always appear to be smiling.</i>

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.330
We're through talking.

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:05.210
She's mean!

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:08.630
Kana, you don't need to be 
in that braggart's club!

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:11.410
You can be in my show.

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:12.590
But...

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:17.140
I still want to be in the 
synchronized swimming club.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:23.730
At our entrance ceremony,

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:27.390
I was so moved when I saw their show

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:30.650
that I accidentally spouted 
salt water from my blowhole!

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:34.150
I want to stand on the stage like they do.

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:37.320
I want to make everyone feel as moved as I did!

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:38.640
Kana...

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:40.700
Hmph. Ridiculous.

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:43.720
A show put on by some animal isn't 
gonna make anyone happy.

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:44.660
Jin!

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:45.980
Licking dog grab!

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:48.380
You came to help us!

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:50.100
We heard what was going on.

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:52.130
We'll help out, too.

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:53.260
So basically...

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:55.340
You want to be in the show, right?

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:57.890
Then you just need to make 
your own talent your weapon.

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:59.470
My talent?

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:02.050
Talent? Like that thing where she blew rings?

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:03.020
No.

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:04.230
Singing!

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:05.440
Singing?

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.690
You know the beluga whale's 
nickname, don't you?

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.150
You don't?!

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:13.410
<i>The beluga whale produces a 
variety of vocalizations,</i>

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:15.640
<i>some of which can be 
heard even above the water.</i>

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:18.780
<i>For this reason, they are known 
as the canaries of the sea.</i>

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:20.830
If you show them your best talent,

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:24.040
you can put on a perfectly good show 
without jumping or splashing around.

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:26.040
O-Oh...

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:29.380
Hey, I know! Let's put on 
a show of our own, then!

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:30.220
Huh?

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:33.530
We'll do synchronized swimming 
moves to Kana's singing!

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:34.380
Huh?

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:37.100
We can present it on the 
last day of seaside school!

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:38.800
That sounds fun!

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:40.530
I'd like to try it!

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:41.970
Me, too.

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:43.020
Right?!

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:46.600
If it goes well, Ruka-senpai will 
have to acknowledge your talent!

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:49.370
Y-Yeah! I'll try my best!

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:50.910
Yay!

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:54.370
Why does that stupid mutt always 
drag us into these messes?

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:55.740
Damn it!

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:58.110
So...

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:05.120
I found school uniforms for all of you!

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:07.380
I wanted to try wearing one of these!

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:08.750
Yay!

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:11.540
Hey, mutt... Good job.

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:16.510
Okay, let's all try swimming right now!

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:23.050
Nice...

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:25.070
Wait! Crap!

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:28.390
Now I won't get any time alone with Hitomi-chan!

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:31.850
Okay, let's do some ad-libbed 
swimming with Kana in the middle!

00:10:31.850 --> 00:10:33.470
Yeah!

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:40.780
<b>Bweeeeh</b>

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:43.990
What is this?!

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:45.990
What is this awful song?!

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:48.290
Y-You're kidding... 
This can't be right!

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:53.660
That was great for a first time!

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:55.300
Was it?

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.410
Wait, where's Miyubi-san?

00:10:58.420 --> 00:10:59.830
Oh. She's dead.

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:01.770
I'm sorry. My singing did this.

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:03.310
Nah, it happens all the time.

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:05.720
Okay, let's try it again!

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:08.700
Gross. That's how the land girls swim?

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:11.570
That Kana hasn't learned her lesson at all.

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:12.350
No, but...

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:15.360
They might make a good opening act for us.

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:23.910
L-Let me see it, too!

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:23.910
<i>Cowaii</i>

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:25.620
Cheers!

00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:31.060
<i>Damn it! These stupid animals 
just won't shut up!</i>

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:32.500
<i>And on top of that...</i>

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.100
<i>I got stuck sharing a room 
with a male giraffe couple!</i>

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:38.130
Neku, let's spend the night 
together again.

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:40.670
Why are you moving it away?!

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:44.140
I never sleep with the same male twice.

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:47.590
You liar! You were toying 
with me all that time!

00:11:47.590 --> 00:11:50.420
W-Wait! Are you in love with another male?!

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:52.850
Sorry.

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:55.360
You animal!

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:59.590
<b>S</b>

00:11:55.360 --> 00:12:00.610
<i>Among giraffes, more than 90% of 
copulation occurs between two males.</i>

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:02.110
Jeez...

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:06.500
Why do I have to be put out by a couple 
of giraffes having a lovers' spat?

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:08.740
Um, excuse me...

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:11.960
You're the synchronized swimming club's...

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:15.980
I'm begging you! Please stop Kana!

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:17.750
Wh-What brought this on?

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:18.340
There you are!

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:19.910
What are you doing out here?

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:21.660
We were worried about you!

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:25.520
<i>She's completely different than 
she was earlier today...</i>

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:27.600
I get it! She's sleeping with half of her brain!

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:29.130
Exactly.

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:30.970
The captain sleeps so deeply

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:34.350
that when half of her brain 
is asleep, her personality changes.

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:38.260
<i>Dolphins and whales sleep with 
half of their brain at one time.</i>

00:12:38.260 --> 00:12:41.230
<i>This is known as unihemispheric 
slow-wave sleep.</i>

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:45.240
Please... stop helping Kana.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:49.540
Even if she gets better at singing, 
she can't join our club.

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:50.530
Why not?

00:12:50.530 --> 00:12:51.450
That's easy.

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:55.540
Belugas and bottlenose dolphins 
are different species,

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:59.840
and two different species 
can't sing and dance in sync.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:04.590
Giving her any more false hope 
will only break her heart more.

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:05.760
So please!

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:08.890
I can't bear to do that to her!

00:13:07.790 --> 00:13:08.890
Captain!

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:10.930
Hey, there's no need to take it that far...

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:12.020
You're asleep?!

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:15.530
For that reason, you will make Kana 
stop her training immediately.

00:13:15.530 --> 00:13:16.590
Got it?

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:24.580
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:26.990
<i>Beluga whale!</i>

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:29.530
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:31.990
<i>Common bottlenose dolphin!</i>

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:33.750
<b>Males</b>

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.970
Well, I guess it's not my problem.

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:48.100
Y-You're...

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:49.510
the giraffe I'm rooming with?!

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:52.350
Let me wash your back for you.

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:55.980
<i>W-Wait... So the other male 
he's in love with is...</i>

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:57.100
Jin-san!

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:58.980
My brother is serious about you!

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:00.650
Who the hell are you?!

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:03.130
I'm his younger sister, Nagashika Kiri!

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:04.820
My brother's normally a total top,

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:07.440
but when it comes to you, he's the kind 
of bottom who'd do anything for—

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:08.580
Who cares?!

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:09.870
Please hear out my feelings...

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:12.090
Hear out my love.

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:14.740
Jin, when I look at you...

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:16.290
I get so turned on!

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:18.330
You mean that in a sexual way?!

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:19.460
Hell no!

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:30.220
That's great! You've gotten much better!

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:33.350
All because you stayed by 
my side and cheered me on!

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:37.100
<i>That dumb dog's been helping 
her train this whole time?</i>

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:40.350
But to be honest, I'm not confident at all.

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:44.610
Being told that singing is my talent 
honestly doesn't make sense to me.

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:46.190
Even if I get better at it,

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:49.420
I still don't think the synchronized 
swimming club will let me join...

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:54.610
Two different species can't 
sing and dance in sync.

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:54.610
<i>Two different species can't 
sing and dance in sync.</i>

00:14:55.090 --> 00:14:57.580
Don't worry! Have faith in Jin!

00:14:58.050 --> 00:15:01.620
Jin said it's your talent, 
so it'll be okay for sure!

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:02.170
Besides,

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:06.670
<b>Coconut Room</b>

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:06.670
<b>Cooking Club Females</b>

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:06.670
<b>☆Boss       Okami Ranka     (Wolf)</b>

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:06.670
<b>Hino Hitomi                    (Human)</b>

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:06.670
<b>Komori Yukari       (Koala)</b>

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:06.670
<b>Shishio Miyubi      (Sloth)</b>

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:06.670
<b>Nekomai Kurumi        (Cat)</b>

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:06.670
<b>Meimei                           (Panda)</b>

00:15:02.570 --> 00:15:05.440
all the members of our cooking 
club are different species,

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:06.670
but we get along great.

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:08.290
We have fun every day,

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:11.430
and we even won our school's 
Field Day together!

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:14.860
It's really fun being with 
Jin and all the others!

00:15:14.860 --> 00:15:16.810
I know you'll have fun, too!

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:18.790
Ranka-san...

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:22.650
You really trust Jin-san a lot, don't you?

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:23.260
Yeah!

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:26.850
Jin's basically my partner, 
or even my husband...

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:29.940
Stop making up nonsense!

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:31.160
Oh, Jin!

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:34.260
Listen, all this vocal training 
won't do you any good.

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:35.030
Just stop.

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:35.490
Huh?

00:15:35.840 --> 00:15:36.740
Huh?

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:40.800
Why?! You're the one who said 
singing was her talent!

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:44.020
Yes, I did say that, but you 
don't sing with your throat.

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:44.920
You sing...

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:46.310
here.

00:15:46.310 --> 00:15:47.090
Huh?

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:50.910
<i>The sounds whales and dolphins 
produce in their nasal cavities</i>

00:15:50.910 --> 00:15:54.450
<i>converge in a structure on their 
heads known as the "melon"</i>

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:55.970
<i>and emerge as sound.</i>

00:15:55.970 --> 00:16:00.480
Belugas are the only cetaceans that 
can change the shape of their melon.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:03.390
Change... my melon?

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:04.570
How?

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:07.010
How should I know?! I'm not a dolphin!

00:16:07.010 --> 00:16:08.690
Give it a try, Kana!

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:11.190
I know you can do it!

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:14.950
All right. I'll try!

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.530
Okay, let's start by 
eating some melons!

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:19.450
I don't think that's how it works.

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:20.570
What? It's not?

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:21.860
I wonder what I'm supposed to do...

00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:23.470
It's not a melon?

00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:24.210
What the heck am I doing?

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:27.210
<i>Thus, their seaside camp began.</i>

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:30.210
<b>Day 2</b>

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:30.210
<b>Swimming in the Ocean</b>

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:30.210
<i>On day two, they swam in the ocean.</i>

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:33.090
<b>Big Haul</b>

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:33.090
<i>On day three, they tried fishing hands-on.</i>

00:16:30.530 --> 00:16:33.090
<b>Day 3: Hands-On Fishing</b>

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:36.340
<i>On day four, they tried making sushi hands-on.</i>

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:36.340
<b>Day 4: 
Making Sushi Hands-On!</b>

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:38.530
<b>Last Day!</b>

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:38.710
<i>And then, on the last day...</i>

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:41.350
Students of Seton Academy!

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:43.610
You've had a productive five days.

00:16:43.610 --> 00:16:46.860
For your seaside school finale, it's show ti—

00:16:47.170 --> 00:16:48.860
...iiiiime!

00:16:57.180 --> 00:16:59.000
So many people...

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:00.380
Isn't it wild?

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:02.330
I can't do this!

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.350
Th-There's no way I can...

00:17:04.350 --> 00:17:05.960
It's okay!

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:08.170
We're with you!

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:09.810
Ranka-san...

00:17:09.810 --> 00:17:12.670
Why are you doing all this for me?

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:15.660
It's just like Ranka to not be selfish at all.

00:17:15.660 --> 00:17:17.160
She's just an idiot.

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:19.170
But if the show is a success,

00:17:19.170 --> 00:17:22.850
lots more people might want 
to join the cooking club.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:24.140
Really?!

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:24.850
Oh, my.

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:26.140
There's the selfishness...

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:30.400
Now for a dream collaboration starring 
students from both schools...

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:33.400
The Seton Academy Cooking Club!

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:42.040
Very well. Let us witness 
this show of yours.

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:50.290
They're so cute!

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:52.670
The cooking club is seeking new members!

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:54.860
I guess that's really all they can do.

00:17:54.860 --> 00:17:56.670
And Kana isn't even there.

00:17:56.990 --> 00:18:00.120
She must have chickened out and 
given up on being in the show.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:02.730
If so, it was a wise decision.

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:08.750
Kana?!

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:31.630
Way to go, Kana!

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:34.160
Sh-She's not bad.

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:36.020
And in such a short time...

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:37.260
B-But..

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:42.510
With a show like <i>that</i>...

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:45.510
They're not good enough to 
be up on the stage.

00:18:45.510 --> 00:18:48.790
Captain, watching this any longer 
would be a waste of time.

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:50.520
Let's stand by for our turn.

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:52.650
Kana...

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:59.400
I'll show you what a real show is.

00:18:59.760 --> 00:19:02.410
To make sure you don't embrace 
any more impossible dreams

00:19:02.760 --> 00:19:05.180
like trying to surpass species boundaries...

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:07.290
I will beat you into the—

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:14.130
Wh-What is this excitement in my melon?

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:18.560
I want to swim.

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:21.310
You're... my right brain?!

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:25.200
I want to swim along to Kana's singing,

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:27.470
to respond to her feelings in kind...

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:28.540
Nonsense!

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:32.440
Belugas and bottlenose dolphins 
can't put on a show together!

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:36.080
Something's different about Kana's song today.

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:38.730
It's almost as if it's calling us...

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:41.450
You feel the same way, don't you?

00:19:42.630 --> 00:19:45.130
The two of us are one.

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:48.450
Let's make our feelings the same.

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:00.950
<i>Ruka-senpai, can you hear me?</i>

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:06.430
Is that...

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:07.810
Ruka-senpai?!

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:10.520
Use your melon more!

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:11.940
Sing!

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.010
Okay!

00:20:15.430 --> 00:20:17.660
<i>Ranka-san and her friends taught me</i>

00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:21.400
<i>that with my song, I can fly as high as Senpai!</i>

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:26.740
<i>She's synchronizing with my 
movements more and more.</i>

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:27.390
<i>It's as if...</i>

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:33.660
<i>It's as if she knows what 
I'm going to do next!</i>

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:37.490
You girls...

00:20:37.490 --> 00:20:40.130
Sorry. When I heard this song...

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:42.920
It made me want to swim, too.

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:46.180
Is this the power of a beluga's song?

00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:54.770
<i>I want my song to reach Senpai!</i>

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:57.900
<i>No, that's not it. This is...</i>

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:01.540
<i>Higher! Much, much higher!</i>

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:04.970
<i>This is... how Kana feels!</i>

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:09.700
<i>Layer our melons together more!</i>

00:21:37.220 --> 00:21:38.860
Wow!

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:41.110
Kana...

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:42.230
Ruka-senpai!

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:46.730
With you, I believe we can create a 
performance like nothing seen before.

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:50.110
I have very high standards.

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:52.330
Do you still want to join me?

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:54.030
Yes!

00:21:57.540 --> 00:21:59.210
Congratulations!

00:21:59.210 --> 00:22:00.540
Yay!

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:06.860
Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:22:09.220 --> 00:22:12.390
I'm so glad you got into the 
synchronized swimming club, Kana!

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:15.440
Yeah! Thank you so much!

00:22:15.440 --> 00:22:19.070
I'm sure there will be some times 
when things don't go well,

00:22:19.070 --> 00:22:20.930
but when that happens,

00:22:20.930 --> 00:22:23.620
I'll remember all of you in the 
cooking club and try my best!

00:22:23.620 --> 00:22:24.530
Yeah!

00:22:24.530 --> 00:22:27.890
Come visit us at the main Seton 
Academy campus sometime, too.

00:22:27.890 --> 00:22:30.500
We'll treat you to our delicious cooking!

00:22:30.500 --> 00:22:32.410
And be in my show, too!

00:22:32.410 --> 00:22:35.380
What? I have to sit on a tire?

00:22:36.990 --> 00:22:39.420
Goodbye!

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:40.980
Zai jian!

00:22:40.980 --> 00:22:43.290
Keep up the great work!

00:22:43.290 --> 00:22:45.880
Come visit us again!

00:22:45.880 --> 00:22:47.780
See you!

00:22:47.780 --> 00:22:49.380
Let's come again sometime, Jin!

00:22:49.380 --> 00:22:51.140
Like hell I will!

00:22:55.780 --> 00:22:57.020
It's so pretty.

00:22:57.370 --> 00:22:59.520
Yeah, it sure is.

00:22:59.870 --> 00:23:02.130
<i>Twenty minutes left until the bus leaves...</i>

00:23:02.130 --> 00:23:04.270
<i>It's finally just the two of us.</i>

00:23:04.270 --> 00:23:07.150
<i>I'm going to let Hitomi-chan 
know how I feel!</i>

00:23:07.490 --> 00:23:10.180
For a long time now, I've really li...

00:23:10.180 --> 00:23:11.830
li... li...

00:23:14.340 --> 00:23:16.290
I'm so happy, Jin.

00:23:16.290 --> 00:23:17.840
N-No, I...

00:23:17.840 --> 00:23:20.570
Now, let us confirm our love 
for each other right away!

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:22.610
Jin!

00:23:22.610 --> 00:23:24.980
Not you!

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:25.730
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:25.730 --> 00:23:26.500
<b>Ranka here!</b>

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:28.360
<b>Meimei here.</b>

00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:29.300
<b>I hope Kana and the others</b>

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:30.380
<b>come visit us at Seton Academy next time!</b>

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:31.220
<b>Too bad!</b>

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:34.220
<b>The next one to come here will be a groupie of mine!</b>

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Huh?!</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:36.850
<b>Mating season is coming, too!</b>

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:38.330
<b>Huh?! What does that mean?!</b>

00:23:38.330 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Seton Academy Record 9</b>

00:23:38.330 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Legends of Animal Ecology</b>
